  ;; =====================================================
  ;; Title block and notes
  ;; =====================================================
  (text "NEBULA Q-SHIELD® — Hierarchical Root Schematic\n\nIndustrial fermentation monitor shield for Arduino UNO Q (4GB)\n12 sensors, 3 actuators, 3 tiers (Essential/Insight/Signature)\nSingle PCB with DNP component selection per tier\n\nDesign decisions:\n- Galvanic isolation: ON-BOARD (Option A) for all wet sensors\n- Display: HMI UART (Nextion/Stone) — NOT HDMI\n- Watchdog: TPS3823 populated ALL tiers\n- RS485: DNP option for Hamilton Incyte/Dencytee\n- Connectors: All polarized/keyed, plug-and-play"
    (at 25.4 25.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)))
    (uuid "87d128fd-8841-4680-899c-07eea2118cbc")
  )

